Be4 21. Bd3 Bxd3 22. Rxd3 Rd7 $1 { Preparing to double rooks on the d-file, while White cannot release the pressure on d4. } ( { The tempting } 22... cxd4 $5 { does not work as well after: } 23. Rxd4 ( 22... Rd7 22. Bxd4 $2 { loses to } e5 ) 
Rxd4 24. Bxd4 Rd8 { Now White must give up a pawn. } 25. g3 ( 24... Rd7 24. Be3 $4 Rd1 ) 
